# PRIVATE BOUNDARY: company-only plans, analytics systems, campaign data,
# execution/audit logs, and maintainer runbooks must never be published to the
# public OSS repository. Keep them here only as a local quarantine and relocate
# durable work to a separately access-controlled private repository or wiki.
docs/internal/

# Defense-in-depth for private marketing systems accidentally created outside
# docs/internal/. These paths must remain absent from the public Git index.
/private/
/.private/
/deploy/marketing-analytics/
/.github/workflows/marketing-analytics-*.yml

# Private testbed CI/CD (references private fleet topology; never published)
